  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "$id": "urn:jenny:schema:cli-v1",
  "title": "Jenny CLI event stream, contract cli.v1",
  "description": "One NDJSON line per event. Every event is a closed object: v=1, kind, event_seq (monotonic per run from 0), run_id, session_id, optional stream_id/turn_id/request_id/work_id (present only where the identity exists), and a closed per-kind payload. Every string is bounded; the limits are stated on each definition. A run ends with exactly one result event.",
